    "body": "# Problem\n\nThe new extended CMake scripts unconditionally builds all targets, negatively impacting Neovim's build time.\n\n# Expected solution\n\nTargets beyond the core lib (docs, tools, tests) should be opt-in, or at least opt-out so Neovim's build script can be adapted to avoid building unnecessary files.",
